@IssueTracker.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000
@TicketId = 1

### Hämta alla supportärenden
GET {{IssueTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/tickets
Accept: application/json

### Skapa supportärende
POST {{IssueTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Plocka en order",
  "description": "Användaren får ogiltig status",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Validera flera fel vid skapande
POST {{IssueTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Kort",
  "description": "Kort",
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

### Radera supportärende
# Ange ärendets ID i TicketId ovan. ID 0 ger 404 Not Found.
DELETE {{IssueTracker.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{TicketId}}
Accept: application/json

###
